WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.460
Thousands of verified questions. Aligned to
the syllabus.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:10.270
Then unlimited more — written by AI, cleared
by four judges.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.990
A twenty-minute quiz. Or the full mock, at
real length.

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.300
Same clock. Same pressure.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.750
Every answer, explained.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.830
And help on the question in front of you — not
a search box.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.170
Chat. Or call.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:30.430
It reads your screen, so you never describe
the question.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.820
Study rooms. Your cohort, live.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.020
Notes, kept beside the question that prompted
them.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.730
Analytics that stay on what matters.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:42.270
It finds the gap you keep falling into.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:47.350
Progress you can see. Streaks that keep you
honest.

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:52.070
Fourteen ways to get ready. One platform.
Certuvo.
